// Paired with measure-z1-apex-raw.ron. `rootkit` is the toughest ordinary
// Mainframe-habitat species at zone 1's danger window (growth_multiplier
// 1.5, the steepest non-boss species that habitat fields) — the closest
// same-build stand-in for "what an ordinary guardian would have been",
// short of literally reproducing the old BOSS_STAT_MULT elevation, which
// `opponents:` staging cannot do (it never sets `boss: true`; see
// `spawn_wild_creature_scaled`). Read this pair as "authored apex vs
// authored toughest-ordinary, single individual, no escort, no depth
// multiplier" — a narrower question than the real fight, but a legitimate
// same-build delta.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 1, zone: 1),
    opponents: [(species: "rootkit", count: 1)],
    reps: 200,
    seed: 5008,
)
